\newlabel{fig:blueprint}{{2}{4}{Control of planning, construction, and repair. AHA-driven and AHA-auto each build a dependency graph from the object inventory. An agent directs execution in original AHa-3D and AHA-driven. In AHA-auto, the planning agent returns the graph to a Python scheduler}{figure.2}{}}
